8	//            Web Speech remains the fallback if the primary STT leg dies
9	//   - LM   → /api/llm (HF router / Mistral / local llama-server), streamed
10	//            clauses — config/lm-models.json
11	//   - TTS  → /api/tts per clause (Mistral or local mlx-audio;
12	//            config/voice-models.json `tts`), browser speechSynthesis fallback
